"</shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>खेल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>नव</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:145
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starts a new game."
msgstr "नूतनं क्रीडां आरभते।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:150
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Replay</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>खेलः</guimenu> <guimenuitem>पुनः क्रीडां</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:153
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Replay the last game."
msgstr "अन्तिमं क्रीडां पुनः क्रीडन्तु।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:157
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>प्रश्न</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>खेल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>निवृत्तं</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:162
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selecting this item will end your current game, and exit &bovo;."
msgstr "एतत् द्रव्यं चित्वा भवतः वर्तमानक्रीडा समाप्तं भविष्यति, &bovo;."

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:167
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap> </keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Undo</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap> </keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>चल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>अवर्ती</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:177
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Undo the last move you made."
msgstr "भवता कृतं अन्तिमं चालनं पूर्ववत् कुरुत।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:182
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>H</keycap> </shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Hint</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>H</keycap> </shortcut> <guimenu>चल</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>सूचना</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:190
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Display</action> a hint for the next move. The game piece suggested "
"by the &bovo; AI then flashes for a brief period of time."
msgstr ""
"<action>प्रदर्शन</action> अग्रिमचरणस्य संकेतः । &bovo; ततः एआइ "
"संक्षिप्तकालं यावत् ज्वलति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:195
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Theme</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu><guisubmenu>विषय</guisubmenu>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:196
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose one of the themes <guimenuitem>Scribble</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>High Contrast</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Spacy</guimenuitem> "
"or <guimenuitem>Gomoku</guimenuitem> for the game."
msgstr ""
"क्रीडायाः कृते <guimenuitem>Scribble</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>उच्चविपरीतता</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>स्थान</guimenuitem> "
"अथवा <guimenuitem>गोमोकु</guimenuitem> इति विषयेषु एकं चिनोतु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:201
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Animation </guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu><guimenuitem>एनिमेशन </guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:203
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Switch the animation on or off."
msgstr "एनिमेशनं चालू वा निष्क्रियं वा कुर्वन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:207
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Difficulty</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu><guisubmenu>कठिनता</guisubmenu>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:208
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose the game difficulty from various levels from "
"<guimenuitem>Ridiculously Easy</guimenuitem> up to "
"<guimenuitem>Impossible</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>हास्यास्पदरूपेण सुलभं</guimenuitem> तः "
"<guimenuitem>असम्भवं</guimenuitem> पर्यन्तं विविधस्तरात् क्रीडाकठिनतां "
"चिनोतु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:214
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &bovo; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the sections "
"about the <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">Settings Menu</ulink> "
"and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"अतिरिक्तरूपेण &bovo; सामान्यं &kde; <guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> तथा "
"<guimenu>सहायता</guimenu> मेनू-वस्तूनाम्, अधिकसूचनार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">सेटिंग्स् मेन्यू< "
"इत्यस्य विषये विभागान् पठन्तु /ulink> तथा च &kde; मौलिकता।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:223
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "बहुधा पृष्टाः प्रश्नाः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:228
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr "अहम् अस्य क्रीडायाः स्वरूपं परिवर्तयितुम् इच्छामि। अहं शक्नोमि ?"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:229
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To change &bovo;'s visual theme you can use the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Theme</guisubmenu> "
"</menuchoice> menu entry on the menubar."
msgstr ""
"आम्‌। &bovo;इत्यस्य दृश्यविषयं परिवर्तयितुं भवान् मेनूपट्टिकायां "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu><guisubmenu>विषय</guisubmenu> "
"</menuchoice> मेनूप्रविष्टिं उपयोक्तुं शक्नोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:233
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to play this game?"
msgstr "एतत् क्रीडां कर्तुं कीबोर्डस्य उपयोगं कर्तुं शक्नोमि वा?"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:234
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. The game of &bovo; cannot be played using keyboard."
msgstr "न & क्रीडा &bovo; कीबोर्डस्य उपयोगेन वादयितुं न शक्यते।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:237
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""
"इदानीं मया क्रीडां त्यक्तव्या, परन्तु अहम् अद्यापि न समाप्तः। अहं मम "
"प्रगतिम् रक्षितुं शक्नोमि वा ?"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:238
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No. There is no <quote>Save</quote> feature in &bovo; but &bovo; restores "
"the latest unfinished game on startup."
msgstr ""
"न.&bovo; किन्तु &bovo; स्टार्टअप इत्यत्र नवीनतमं असमाप्तं क्रीडां पुनः "
"स्थापयति।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:241
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where are the highscores?"
msgstr "उच्चाङ्काः कुत्र सन्ति ?"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:242
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "&bovo; does not have this feature."
msgstr "&बोवो; न भवति एतत् विशेषता ।"

